{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Suppress payload failures from children already excluded by early completion.** This unconditional rethrow can call `failInvocation` after a map/parallel parent has begun successful early completion, allowing an irrelevant late branch load failure to retry or fail the entire workflow. Arbitrate this under the parent's completion lock: propagate only if the child wins before completion; otherwise complete it as skipped. Add an early-completion race test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7onWF1","finding_digest":"a4a0de8f8a28f4914044834e2ac9cd75891cdd7d701513632e0698bfdb9f3680","finding_id":"arf_v1_usqn5d4kfd2jcqceqnhcvsonow","finding_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::executechildcontext::post-completion-payload-failure","identity_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::executechildcontext::post-completion-payload-failure","line":152,"observation_digest":"c85a4578442726027273689ba5b7196c598e6f2b796dfa6881d1c98dbff5180a","observation_id":"aro_v1_zbnek6cee4tae4ttncn2lnyznr","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/ChildContextOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T09:16:26Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uk25wro7hzsaazcmfdmuvbyu5a","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"6c619383c8c605b87c7b2560a8e94006013c7a34","reviewer":"codex","start_line":151,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_c3kpdyvgzdss5dow3d6o4m2olk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T09:16:26Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
